00:21:39.850 --> 00:21:41.490
MARK MANDEL: So how many
records are we talking about?

00:21:41.490 --> 00:21:41.820
AMY KRISHNAMOHAN: Yeah.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:43.650
They're actually
using a Select Query,

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:47.980
